      "id": "player_overworking_002_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "止まれない感じがする時ほど、止まる理由を外に置いたほうがいい。",
      "translatedText": "The more it feels like you cannot stop, the more you should place the reason to stop outside your head.",
      "emotion": "focused",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "focused",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "player_overworking_002_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_overworking_002_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "タイマー、飲み物、メモ一行。何でもいい。区切りを作ろう。",
      "translatedText": "A timer, a drink, one note. Anything is fine. Let us make a boundary.",
      "emotion": "gentle",
